WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:07.580
The finite neutral complex answers an algebraic question. In the generic stratum, every closed direction is

00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:15.930
gauge. The quotient has dimension zero. Exact minors and rank nullity certify this statement. They do not

00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:20.250
certify the continuous operator or a Higgs mass.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.625
Switch to the restored stratum. One closed class remains after quotienting by gauge directions. This exact

00:00:28.625 --> 00:00:34.870
distinction is useful for testing hypotheses about the scalar sector. It is separate from the continuous

00:00:34.870 --> 00:00:38.125
vector spectrum shown next.

00:00:38.875 --> 00:00:44.905
At the exact Wilson angle one fifth, the light eigenvalue lies between two hundred forty four over eight

00:00:44.905 --> 00:00:51.515
thousand four hundred twenty five, and four over one hundred twenty five. The guaranteed gap is three

00:00:51.515 --> 00:00:57.930
hundred thirty seven over four thousand. These are rational bounds for the continuous operator, with its

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:03.375
boundary conditions, in the stated five component active block.

00:01:04.125 --> 00:01:11.235
Choose one quarter. The lower endpoint is one over twenty eight and the upper endpoint is one twentieth. The

00:01:11.235 --> 00:01:18.380
fixed model has unit lengths and boundary strengths, with eta zero. Three decoupled zero directions are kept

00:01:18.380 --> 00:01:25.625
separately. Changing the unrelated fermion controls does not change this certified model.

00:01:26.375 --> 00:01:33.250
The written proof first bounds the second eigenvalue using means, traces and the min max principle. A smooth

00:01:33.250 --> 00:01:39.960
trial function satisfies all operator boundary conditions. Its exact Rayleigh quotient and residual enter

00:01:39.960 --> 00:01:47.465
the published Temple inequality. The downloaded proof states these analytic arguments. The symbolic verifier

00:01:47.465 --> 00:01:54.083
checks their algebra and the rational endpoints; software tests alone are not the proof.

00:01:54.833 --> 00:02:01.268
Download the proof and verifier, and replay the certificate with SymPy. The enclosure establishes

00:02:01.268 --> 00:02:08.808
positivity, simplicity and isolation in this conditional model. It does not certify the Wilson derivative, R

00:02:08.808 --> 00:02:17.068
Z W, a vacuum, currents or a physical Higgs direction. Do not differentiate interval endpoints. The live

00:02:17.068 --> 00:02:21.750
demo, manual and certificate preserve these limits.

